sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutateWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>/mutate-notebook-v1<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant ValidateWH as Validating Webhook<br/>/validate-notebook-v1<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant NR as NotebookReconciler
    participant OR as OpenshiftNotebookReconciler
    participant CR as CullingReconciler

    Note over User,CR: Notebook Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply Notebook CR<br/>(kubeflow.org/v1)
    K8sAPI->>MutateWH: POST /mutate-notebook-v1<br/>TLS, Kubernetes Admission
    MutateWH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook spec<br/>(inject defaults, OAuth proxy)
    K8sAPI->>ValidateWH: POST /validate-notebook-v1<br/>TLS, Kubernetes Admission
    ValidateWH-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook CR created

    Note over NR,CR: Reconciliation Loop

    K8sAPI->>NR: Watch event: Notebook created
    NR->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet<br/>TLS 1.2+
    NR->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>NR: Resources created

    K8sAPI->>OR: Watch event: Notebook created
    OR->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OR->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>(Gateway API)
    OR->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OR->>K8sAPI: Create RoleBinding<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OR->>K8sAPI: Manage OAuthClient<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OR->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OR->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Secret<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>OR: Resources created

    Note over CR: Idle Culling Flow

    loop Idleness Check Period
        CR->>K8sAPI: List Notebook CRs<br/>TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>CR: Notebook list
        CR->>K8sAPI: Get Pod status<br/>TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>CR: Pod metadata (last activity)
        alt Notebook idle > CULL_IDLE_TIME
            CR->>K8sAPI: Update Notebook<br/>(stop annotation)
            CR->>K8sAPI: Delete Pod<br/>TLS 1.2+
        end
    end

    Note over User,CR: CRD Version Conversion

    User->>K8sAPI: Get Notebook (v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI->>MutateWH: POST /convert<br/>TLS, Kubernetes Admission
    MutateWH-->>K8sAPI: Converted Notebook<br/>(v1alpha1 format)
    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook (v1alpha1)
